WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Choose a saved logo, place it on the current page and move it to the top-right corner.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Resize the selected logo and refine its position in Image details.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Expand Save as preset, enter a name and choose Save. A confirmation reports that the preset was saved.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.500
The selected logo remains on the page. Copy to pages is then used to add it to three other pages.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.370
Open the target pages and check the logo in the saved size and position.
